description=Hotfix: supervised refresh controller, HAL-restart recovery and observed 120 Hz verification; X6886 GSI patch v14.4.1: 0.4x framework animations, 144 Hz normally with 120 Hz for FOD/enrolment/SOFOD, compatible-mode detection and reversible settings; DRAM lock (4266 MHz on / 1866 MHz off), safe HBM watchdog, AOD-aware idle dexopt and download lag fix. GPU governor and DT2W removed; thermal cutoff retained.
